{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 10, :comments ["<b>From old age</b> — written defective (חסר), corresponding to \"And it came to pass that when Isaac was old, and his eyes were dim\" (Genesis 27:1). Just as Jacob deceived his father in the blessing, so that his eyes grew dim, so did his son do to him in blessing them — for Joseph switched Manasseh for Ephraim upon him."], :book :genesis, :voice :baal-haturim, :lang :en, :chapter 48, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Kitzur Baal HaTurim" "http://sefaria.org"] ["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-12T19:18:34.388060455Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}